flowchart TD
    A([Press Start Camera]) --> B[Camera turns on]
    B --> C[App takes one video picture]
    C --> D{Do we see a hand?}
    D -- No --> E[Show: 'Please show your hand']
    E --> C
    D -- Yes --> F[Find 21 little dot spots on the hand]
    F --> G[Turn the dots into a hand map]
    G --> H{Did the user tap Save example?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Save the hand map with the chosen letter]
    I --> J[(Save progress in localStorage)]
    H -- No --> K[Look at the saved hand maps]
    J --> K
    K --> L[Compare the new hand map to the saved ones]
    L --> M[Pick the closest match]
    M --> N[Show the best letter guess on screen]
    N --> C
